#%PAM-1.0
# The lock screen of SherlockOS (sherlockos-lock): the password of the session's user, checked
# as the console login checks it, like swaylock's service. The delay of pam_faildelay (3 s in
# Debian's login) slows the tries; failures are not counted, since the lock screen runs as the
# user and cannot write the counters of pam_faillock. Installed in /etc/pam.d/ by the author:
# `just install-session` prints the command.
auth     include  login
account  include  login
